# .trivyignore — accepted Trivy config findings. scan.yaml scans this tree;
# the upstream Gitea/Jenkins charts are not vendored (Zarf pulls them at create
# time), so the findings concern the three helper charts and the values files.
# Security contexts there are explicit and PSA-restricted; the codes below are
# Trivy's stricter-than-PSA checks (uid > 10000, limits on init containers,
# read-only root FS) and Jenkins' agent RBAC, accepted on purpose.
